# Trimmed multi-boot cloud-init.log from a Rocky Linux 9.7 VM (cloud-init 24.4-7.el9_7.1).
# Same OS disk booted several times. Two boots shown below:
#   BOOT 6 (2026-06-02) = source/template VM, FRESH provisioning ISO on /dev/sr0, CustomData injected (168 bytes).
